    "verseCount": 5,
    "content": "<p class=\"d\">A Song of Ascents.</p><p class=\"q1\"><span data-number=\"1\" data-sid=\"PSA 125:1\" class=\"v\">1</span>Those who trust in Yahweh are as Mount Zion,</p><p data-vid=\"PSA 125:1\" class=\"q2\">which can’t be moved, but remains forever.</p><p class=\"q1\"><span data-number=\"2\" data-sid=\"PSA 125:2\" class=\"v\">2</span>As the mountains surround Jerusalem,</p><p data-vid=\"PSA 125:2\" class=\"q2\">so Yahweh surrounds his people from this time forward and forever more.</p><p class=\"q1\"><span data-number=\"3\" data-sid=\"PSA 125:3\" class=\"v\">3</span>For the scepter of wickedness won’t remain over the allotment of the righteous,</p><p data-vid=\"PSA 125:3\" class=\"q2\">so that the righteous won’t use their hands to do evil.</p><p class=\"q1\"><span data-number=\"4\" data-sid=\"PSA 125:4\" class=\"v\">4</span>Do good, Yahweh, to those who are good,</p><p data-vid=\"PSA 125:4\" class=\"q2\">to those who are upright in their hearts.</p><p class=\"q1\"><span data-number=\"5\" data-sid=\"PSA 125:5\" class=\"v\">5</span>But as for those who turn away to their crooked ways,</p><p data-vid=\"PSA 125:5\" class=\"q2\">Yahweh will lead them away with the workers of iniquity.</p><p data-vid=\"PSA 125:5\" class=\"q1\">Peace be on Israel.</p>",
